    "caption": "🔍 Alibaba releases Qwen3.8 models for local use\n\nAlibaba opened weights for two Qwen3.8 models, including the new Qwen3.8-27B with 27 billion parameters designed for local deployment. It supports text and images, handles up to 262,000 tokens context, expandable to about 1 million tokens.\n\nQwen3.8-27B is compact enough for local use and outperforms Qwen3.7-Plus, especially in programming and office tasks. The weights are under Apache 2.0 license, allowing free use in commercial projects.\n\nAlongside, Alibaba released Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B with 2.4 trillion parameters, suitable for heavy server workloads. This creates a range from compact local models to flagship-level infrastructure agents.\n\n📊@tech",
